8que :\n- Mangas\n- Webtoons\n- Bandes dessin\u00e9es\n- Comics\n\nModifiez l'environnement pour changer l'ambiance de vos lectures.\nUtilisez les contr\u00f4les Oculus Quest pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d4PIEW8vNGMQ7kNvwEVicls&_nc_oc=Ado2iR4Fa00r6yfl3-tme2iACk1gM_TxLYfJy-Mchsi9WYLlaI42RwGuHMTB3BLbZFM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjcn43lGeDnxHRSiQJmtYln4S_QKe5E144wEIJZkWl8g&oe=6B045A34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LGfos2c9svcQ7kNvwHMOKsx&_nc_oc=AdrAd65c6tbFWbpLNJO4-cIwVbpbZzfpvKBhEXp4GdMQaE3xlNW6twnhrTFuJxHpYlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1cc4FDWE8HadezdHQ--CSu2oBL-6zqYIlsEc8rg_WaQ&oe=6B045B96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e_0os2qyoSgQ7kNvwE4L1qI&_nc_oc=Adp_ABYU_cOZUHOHBuOQjSI_nzOWPbt5Hjoy1czFNVWUnU5q519FO